---
description: Bind every assignment role to mission skill, access, completion and time requirements.
args: { mission: MissionDossier; change: MissionChange }
returns: MissionRequirement[]
---
Preserve each role as a distinct requirement. A role's qualification and access conditions must be grounded in the mission source; do not weaken them to fill a team. Record the mission window and the evidence that proves completion. Keep conflicting requirement versions unresolved until the coordinator obtains an authorized clarification.
